+package dotty.tools.dotc.sbt
+
+/** Local stand-ins for `xsbti.api.DependencyContext`/`xsbti.UseScope`
+ *  (from `org.scala-sbt:compiler-interface`, the real zinc integration
+ *  artifact -- confirmed to have no Scala Native cross-build). This
+ *  toolchain never wires in a real zinc `xsbti.AnalysisCallback` (there is
+ *  no incremental-recompilation build tool driving this compiler that
+ *  way), so `ExtractDependencies`'s `DependencyRecorder` -- used
+ *  unconditionally from `typer/Synthesizer.scala`, `typer/Typer.scala`, and
+ *  `transform/Inlining.scala`, not just from the `ExtractDependencies`
+ *  phase itself -- only needs to record and later iterate these values
+ *  locally, never hand them to a real `xsbti`-typed callback. See
+ *  docs/findings.md's "frontend-only smoke test" scoping.
+ *
+ *  Same member names as their `xsbti` originals, so callers are unchanged
+ *  beyond the import.
+ */
+enum DependencyContext derives CanEqual:
+  case DependencyByMemberRef, DependencyByInheritance, LocalDependencyByInheritance
+
+enum UseScope derives CanEqual:
+  case Default, PatMatTarget
